<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-024-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.153685" lon="-120.788686"><name>SC26-024-A</name><cmt>SC26-024</cmt><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 16.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 86/100; not catch probability. Center 68 ft; nearby 44–94 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-006</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.15617567933256" lon="-120.78933255284073"/><trkpt lat="35.15563905601368" lon="-120.78956661163258"/><trkpt lat="35.15555295617615" lon="-120.78978847662337"/><trkpt lat="35.15510243208456" lon="-120.78980066717922"/><trkpt lat="35.155016331747994" lon="-120.79002253045736"/><trkpt lat="35.154385597853675" lon="-120.79003959501439"/><trkpt lat="35.154379591115095" lon="-120.7897104597679"/><trkpt lat="35.15383495721556" lon="-120.7895056662889"/><trkpt lat="35.15382894910802" lon="-120.78917653337874"/><trkpt lat="35.15310410484144" lon="-120.78897662233716"/><trkpt lat="35.152823774305894" lon="-120.7884353908422"/><trkpt lat="35.15227513111626" lon="-120.78801119173606"/><trkpt lat="35.15226711500268" lon="-120.78757235669624"/><trkpt lat="35.15162435499847" lon="-120.78693119126191"/><trkpt lat="35.15161834022486"